        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are evolving our agriculture portfolio, transitioning from traditional citrus operations to positioning ~25% of our land holdings for strategic development opportunities, balancing near-term and long-term growth potential, while ~75% of our land holdings remain for diversified agricultural ventures.",
